  (global_label "GND" (shape passive) (at 831.85 601.98 0) (fields_autoplaced yes) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left)) (uuid "673eea83-df18-405b-b8d3-e5a7a2ae366b"))
  (text "Gen5 redrivers (Aidan 2026-10-28): U20 DS320PR1601 GPU x16 (A side = J1/CPU, B side = GPU face), U21/U22 DS320PR810 SSD x8 (FS lanes 0-3 / 4-7), U23 PT5161L fallback DNP (no pins, NDA, NOT pin-compatible-assumed).\nHigh-speed nets *_A / *_B are NOT yet spliced into FP_*/FS_* (J1->J9/J10 copper still direct): net split + reroute pending.\n3V3_RDRV is a NEW rail, source TBD (~10.5 W max = 3.2 A @3.3 V; 3V3_SB buck is 3 A standby, not used).\nU20 address straps TBD per SNLS683 Tbl 7-3/8-1. U21 0x18/0x19, U22 0x1A/0x1B (SNLS668 Tbl 7-5)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 360 470 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left)) (uuid "34f5abe0-10b3-427e-aee3-6481ee7892f5"))
