  (text "Rev 7b (Aidan 2026-10-28): PSU is 12 V only; base fed only via J1. U24 TPS565208 (5 A) 12V_MAIN_IN -> 3V3_RDRV for U20-U22 (~10.5 W). J9/J10 MCIO stand-ins set off-board; J11 GPU / J12 SSD MEG-Array faces. NOTE: J1 has no 12 V pins yet (12V_MAIN_IN still enters on J2)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 599.44 640.08 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left)) (uuid "e1f28c05-3ed8-4203-a834-d62df252c35a"))
